The boot transcript below is a NetBSD amd64 console capture, trimmed to the
part the boot test looks at. It is used by tests/fixtures/fake-provider.sh
as the canned serial log of the fake VM, and the "no login prompt" case is
derived from it by cutting the transcript before the prompt.

